<title>GREECE: SOCCER-CROATIA BEAT GREECE 1-0 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-CROATIA BEAT GREECE 1-0 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>SALONIKA 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Croatia beat Greece 1-0</p>
<p>(halftime 0-0) in their World Cup soccer European group one</p>
<p>qualifier on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Scorer: Davor Suker, 74</p>
<p>Attendance: 35,000.</p>
<p>Teams:</p>
<p>Greece - 1-Ilias Atmatzidis, 2-Stratos Apostolakis</p>
<p>(13-Costas Kostandinidis 46th) , 3-Michalis Kasapis, 4-Marinos</p>
<p>Ouzounidis, 5-Kyriakos Karataidis, 6-Nikos Dabizas, 7-Theodore</p>
<p>Zagorakis, 8-Demis Nikolaidis (16-Nikos Machlas 13th), 9-Ilias</p>
<p>Poursanidis, 10-Costas Franzeskos, 11-George Donis.</p>
<p>Croatia - 1-Drazen Ladic, 3-Robert Jarni, 6-Slaven Bilic,</p>
<p>7-Aljosa Asanovic, 8-Robert Prosinecki (19-Goran Vlaovic 72nd)</p>
<p>9-Davor Suker, 10-Svonimir Boban, 11-Alen Boksic (21-Igor</p>
<p>Cvitanovic (67th), 14-Svonimir Soldo (4-Silvio Maric 53rd),</p>
<p>20-Dario Simic, 25-Goran Juiric.</p>
<p>    Standings	 P   W   D   L   F   A  Pts</p>
<p> Denmark		4   3   1   0   9   2  10</p>
<p> Greece		 6   3   1   2   8   4  10</p>
<p> Croatia		5   2   3   0  10   6   6</p>
<p> Bosnia		 4   1   0   3   3   9   3</p>
<p> Slovenia	     5   0   1   4   4  13   1</p>
